{
  "slug": "aldc-al-development-plugin-for-business-central",
  "name": "Aldc Al Development Plugin For Business Central",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ALDC (AL Development Collection) transforms how you develop Business Central extensions with Claude Code.\nInstead of ad-hoc code generation, ALDC provides structured, contract-driven development with human-in-the-loop gates.ALDC (AL Development Collection) is a comprehensive AI-assisted development\ntoolkit for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.\n\nIt provides 4 specialized agents (architect, conductor, developer, presales),\n11 domain knowledge skills (API, events, pages, performance, testing, etc.),\nand 6 development workflows (spec creation, build, PR preparation, etc.).\n\nKey features:\n• Extension-only development — never modifies base application objects\n• Human-in-the-Loop gates at critical decision points\n• TDD/spec-driven development cycle\n• Event-driven architecture patterns\n• Skills Evidencing — agents declare which skills and patterns they applied\n• 8 path-scoped AL rules (injected via /aldc:al-initialize)\n• 3 MCP servers for AL symbols, documentation, and Microsoft Learn\n\nFirst-time setup: run /aldc:al-initialize in your AL project directory.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **10 agents**, **10 commands**, **3 hooks** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `skill-agent-instructions` (Generate, review, and optimize natural language instructions for Business Central agents (Designer or SDK)), `skill-agent-task-patterns` (Agent SDK task integration patterns for Business Central), `skill-agent-toolkit` (Build, configure, and integrate Business Central agents using the AI Development Toolkit and Agent SDK), `skill-api` (AL API development patterns for Business Central), `skill-contribution-assistant` (Guides contributors to design, polish, and submit high-quality skills for AL Copilot Skill Collection), `skill-copilot` (AL Copilot capability development for Business Central), `skill-debug` (AL debugging and diagnostics for Business Central), `skill-estimation` (AL project estimation for Business Central), and 7 more\n- **Agents** (10): `al-agent-builder` (Agent Toolkit Builder specialist in designing and coding Business Central agents using the AI Development Toolkit and Agent…), `al-architect` (AL Architecture and Design assistant for Business Central extensions), `al-conductor` (Orchestrates Planning, Implementation, Review, and Commit cycle for AL Development), `al-developer` (Tactical implementation specialist for Business Central extensions), `al-implement-subagent` (Internal TDD implementation subagent), `al-planning-subagent` (Internal AL-aware research and context gathering subagent for Business Central development), `al-presales` (Technical PreSales Agent for AL/Business Central projects), `al-review-subagent` (Internal quality assurance subagent for Business Central AL code), and 2 more\n- **Commands** (10): `al-agent-create` (End-to-end workflow to create a coded Business Central agent using the Agent SDK), `al-agent-instructions-create` (Generate optimized natural language instructions for Business Central agents (Designer or SDK)), `al-agent-task` (Generate AL code for Business Central Agent SDK task integration), `al-agent-test` (Generate comprehensive test codeunits for Business Central Agent SDK integrations), `al-build` (Build, package, and deploy AL extensions to Business Central environments), `al-context-create` (Generate or update context.md file documenting project structure, architecture, and key patterns for AI assistants and developers), `al-initialize` (Initialize AL development environment and workspace for Business Central), `al-memory-create` (Generate or update memory.md file tracking decisions, changes, and learnings throughout project development for continuity across sessions), and 2 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (3): `al-symbols-mcp`, `context7`, `microsoft-docs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aldc-al-development-plugin-for-business-central@claude-community` from `javiarmesto/ALDC-AL-Development-Collection-for-GitHub-Copilot` (`claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
